  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: cxf-rt-rs-security-sso-oidc 4.2.2.rhlw-00008",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released org.apache.cxf:cxf-rt-rs-security-sso-oidc 4.2.2.rhlw-00008 with backported fixes for CVE-2026-57817 and CVE-2026-65583.\n\nCVE-2026-57817: Apache CXF: The authorization code hash (c_hash) is not enforced for the hybrid OIDC flow\n\nCVE-2026-65583: Apache CXF: Self-issued ID token claims validation skipped\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for org.apache.cxf:cxf-rt-rs-security-sso-oidc 4.2.2 from Maven Central.",
